/-- Volume (up to the universal factor ω_{m}) of the geodesic ball of radius r in the model
space form of curvature K and dimension n = m + 1. -/
noncomputable def modelBallVolume (K : ℝ) (m : ℕ) (r : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∫ t in (0)..r, jacobiSol K t ^ m
```

